Bundled fonts (desk app)

The desk app (src/) bundles three typefaces as web-font files. They are
taken, unmodified, from the @fontsource npm packages (repackaged Google
Fonts releases) and emitted next to the app by the build; nothing is
loaded from a font CDN. These fonts are NOT covered by the Apache License
above. Each is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
<https://openfontlicense.org>. The full licence text is the LICENSE file
of each package (node_modules/<package>/LICENSE), and every font file
carries its copyright notice and the licence URL in its metadata.

